changed.Text:
Healing happens through combat. When a monster dies, you may heal for 1 HP, with higher chance at low HP. However, comestibles don’t provide healing anymore, except for ambrosia berries still healing %d HP.

Vampiric Bat players start with an extra “vampirism” charge and get another one at map level 5, instead of healing on monster death. Less frequent healing but more active control over it!

@SRecommended for players that want to try an alternate experience with a single source of healing.@N

changed.Translation:
通过战斗恢复生命。怪物死亡时，你有机会恢复 1 点生命值；生命值越低，触发概率越高。但食物不再恢复生命，仙馔莓除外，它仍可恢复 %d 点生命值。

吸血蝙蝠玩家开局会额外获得一次“吸血”充能，并在第 5 层再获得一次，不再通过击杀怪物回血。回血机会更少，但更容易主动掌控！

@S推荐给想体验单一回血来源的玩家。@N
